00:00:59.579 --> 00:01:04.460
Instead, a lunatic Republican Governor Ron
DeSantis is like, sure, do whatever you want.

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:08.670
The latest news is that many Republicans are
saying they're not going to go.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:10.400
